      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEAR NO GRIEF (2) produced a modest effort most recently when sixth at this track over 320m behind Spring Cruiser (18.76) in a Grade 5. Got the money at her only try from this box. Better than last start and worth following up. AVOCA STAR (1) showed good pace from out wide and was prominent early but began to paddle and faded out of it when 7th at Bulli in Grade 5 company. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SHACOBY LAD (7) has been in the money at his last two runs, most recently when second beaten 8 lengths (18.87). Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Overdue and gets his chance.",
